| TeX Live 2026 for RISC OS: the commands, run by !Boot and !Run.
|
| Each command runs a program in bin.riscos. The program finds the rest of
| TeX Live from its own location (kpathsea's SELFAUTOPARENT is !TeXLive), so
| nothing else needs setting. Running pdftex with -progname=pdflatex loads the
| pdflatex format, as running it under the name pdflatex would.
|
| %%*0 becomes %*0 in each alias: the arguments given to the command. The
| programs load SharedUnixLibrary themselves when they start.
Set Alias$pdftex Run <TeXLive$Dir>.bin.riscos.pdftex %%*0
Set Alias$pdflatex Run <TeXLive$Dir>.bin.riscos.pdftex -progname=pdflatex %%*0
Set Alias$kpsewhich Run <TeXLive$Dir>.bin.riscos.kpsewhich %%*0
